      "start_seconds": 43.11,
      "end_seconds": 53.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.5,
      "text": "it, It usually comes with night sweats so, you know, the the night sweats? That's been for three weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.41,
      "end_seconds": 59.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Any blood in the stool or coughing up blood at all?"
    },
