      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.62,
      "end_seconds": 69.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "and what about vomiting or bone pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.85,
      "end_seconds": 73.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.71,
      "end_seconds": 77.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "So, is your mobility otherwise okay?"
