    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.06,
      "end_seconds": 89.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.9,
      "end_seconds": 95.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.39,
      "end_seconds": 102.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "Let me think, I've had high cholesterol for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.07,
      "end_seconds": 118.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.33,
      "end_seconds": 128.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "Sorry, um, what was I saying, yes, plasters. I get a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.86,
      "end_seconds": 134.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Right, is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.28,
      "end_seconds": 137.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "my cousin has psoriasis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.92,
      "end_seconds": 142.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.86,
      "end_seconds": 149.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Just a caesarean for my second baby, nine years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.93,
      "end_seconds": 154.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Let's talk a a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.21,
      "end_seconds": 167.43,
      "duration_seconds": 11.22,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I live with my elderly mother. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.08,
      "end_seconds": 182.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.27,
      "end_seconds": 191.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.52,
      "end_seconds": 207.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 15, pulse 67, pressure 118 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.0,
      "end_seconds": 210.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.91,
      "end_seconds": 214.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.66,
      "end_seconds": 218.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.2,
      "end_seconds": 232.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.89,
      "end_seconds": 236.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.81,
      "end_seconds": 248.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "your tummy is soft and I can't feel any lumps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.84,
      "end_seconds": 252.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.88,
      "end_seconds": 270.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.48,
      "end_seconds": 272.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.1,
      "end_seconds": 287.14,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "thank you, you can get dressed. So, based on the history and the examination, my working impression is an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.28,
      "end_seconds": 290.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.0,
      "end_seconds": 326.45,
      "duration_seconds": 34.45,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. I think blood tests makes sense here, for weight loss. I'll request a thyroid test, it'll help with weight loss. Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. We'll refer you to the chest clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.35,
      "end_seconds": 338.18,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "A chest X-ray is something we might do if this doesn't improve in a month. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.17,
      "end_seconds": 345.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.51,
      "end_seconds": 347.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
